ets users pick an accent color or theme color for their workspace.\",{\"children\":\"A settings page lets users pick an accent color or theme color for their workspace.\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"A form needs a small set of label or tag colors that submit like any other radio field.\",{\"children\":\"A form needs a small set of label or tag colors that submit like any other radio field.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 font-medium text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Accessibility\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2\",\"children\":\"Every swatch is a native radio input inside a fieldset, so arrow keys move between swatches the way the browser handles radio groups, and focus shows an outline around the visible swatch. Each item requires a label prop that becomes its accessible name, so selection never relies on color alone, and ColorSelectorLabel renders a legend for the group. With reduced motion enabled, the ring jumps to the new swatch without the hop and the press scale is removed.\"}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 font-medium text-foreground\",\"children\":\"FAQ\"}],[\"$\",\"dl\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-2 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"How do I make a color swatch picker in React?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium text-foreground\",\"children\":\"How do I make a color swatch picker in React?\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-1\",\"children\":\"Render ColorSelector with a ColorSelectorLabel and a ColorSelectorList of ColorSelectorItem elements, each with a value, a color and a label.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Can I control which color is selected?\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"dt\",null,{\"className\":\"font-medium text-foreground\",\"children\":\"Can I control which color is selected?\"}],[\"$\",\"dd\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-1\",\"children\":\"Yes. Pass value and onValueChange for controlled use, or defaultValue for uncontrolled use.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Does the color selector work with 